{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/create_route.py","reason":"New create route selector + pure coordinate_full_create composition (create+containment) + dependent gate + live outbound wiring; the cutover core."},{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/apply_outbound.py","reason":"Cut the outbound create leaf to the coordinated write-ahead path by default; legacy create+delete-rollback retained only behind the rollback selector."},{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/apply_inbound.py","reason":"Consult the single selector for symmetry; confirmation gates dependents while retired/dedup short-circuits are preserved."},{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/batch_dispatch.py","reason":"route_for decides create via the single selector; reroute predicate pinned to non-create families so a create is never mis-routed to coordinate_and_fuse."},{"path":"docs/env-vars.md","reason":"Document the REBAR_RECONCILER_CREATE_ROUTE rollback selector."},{"path":"tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/mutate/test_create_operation_coordinator.py","reason":"Cloud/DC crash-restart oracle, dependency gating, route/no-dual-send, known-key safety abort."},{"path":"tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/test_write_ahead_recovery.py","reason":"Keyed zero-search regression + write-ahead order through the coordinated path."},{"path":"tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/test_index_lag_duplicate_heldout.py","reason":"Keyless unbind requires both 3 misses and 3600s; index-lag duplicate prevention."},{"path":"tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/orchestrate/test_reconcile_filter.py","reason":"Per-entry recovery failure independence; filter/read-only/tombstone zero-early-effect under the coordinator route."},{"path":"tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/orchestrate/test_leaves_effect_matrix.py","reason":"Outbound create leaf now exercised on both routes."},{"path":"tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/mutate/test_operation_coordinator.py","reason":"route_for create-selector regression."},{"path":"tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/mutate/test_apply_outbound_create_rollback.py","reason":"Legacy create+delete-rollback pinned behind the rollback selector."},{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/dispatch_one.py","reason":"Extracted create_one's create->contain MIDDLE core into _legacy_create_core (the rollback value) behind a zero-branch create_core selector kwarg (complexity 36->27); prelude/postlude unchanged. The live batch create seam the coordinated core slots into."},{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/apply_handlers.py","reason":"handle_create reads create_route() and selects the create MIDDLE core once (_select_create_core) — the SINGLE live-batch consumption point for the selector, mirroring the ADR-0103 summary_executor cutover. Binds deferred_creates+mutation for commit_unknown defer."},{"path":"tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/mutate/test_create_live_cutover_heldout.py","reason":"Held-out live-path tests driving the real applier.apply([create_dict],...) batch entry point across both routes; assert one create + forward/reverse binding + outcome/REST count + 404 soft-fail + non-404 fail-fast + landed-unconfirmed no-delete alert (contract parity)."}]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"FILE_IMPACT","timestamp":1787717437127263001,"uuid":"a81d8ce9-2170-4c74-bfd6-39906ae6ce3f"}